## MATLAB — פונקציות רלוונטיות

| פונקציה / כלי | תפקיד |
|---|---|
| `imagePretrainedNetwork` | טעינת רשת מאומנת והחלפת head |
| `freezeNetwork` | הקפאת learnable parameters |
| `trainnet` | fine-tuning |
| `augmentedImageDatastore` | preprocessing תואם |



```matlab
% Self-contained transfer example using MATLAB's bundled digit data.
rng default
[Xsrc,Ysrc,Xtarget,Ytarget] = digitTrain4DArrayData;
layers = [imageInputLayer([28 28 1],'Normalization','none','Name','input')
          convolution2dLayer(3,8,'Padding','same','Name','conv')
          reluLayer('Name','features')
          maxPooling2dLayer(2,'Stride',2)
          fullyConnectedLayer(10)
          softmaxLayer
          classificationLayer];
srcOpts = trainingOptions('adam','MaxEpochs',2,'MiniBatchSize',128, ...
                          'Shuffle','every-epoch','Verbose',false);
sourceNet = trainNetwork(Xsrc,Ysrc,layers,srcOpts);
wanted = (Ytarget=='3') | (Ytarget=='8');
Xtarget = Xtarget(:,:,:,wanted); Ytarget = Ytarget(wanted);
i3=find(Ytarget=='3'); i8=find(Ytarget=='8');
tr=[i3(1:12);i8(1:12)]; te=setdiff((1:numel(Ytarget))',tr);
Ftr=activations(sourceNet,Xtarget(:,:,:,tr),'features','OutputAs','rows');
Fte=activations(sourceNet,Xtarget(:,:,:,te),'features','OutputAs','rows');
transferHead=fitclinear(Ftr,Ytarget(tr),'Learner','logistic');
transferAccuracy=mean(predict(transferHead,Fte)==Ytarget(te));
raw=reshape(Xtarget,[],size(Xtarget,4))';
rawHead=fitclinear(raw(tr,:),Ytarget(tr),'Learner','logistic');
rawAccuracy=mean(predict(rawHead,raw(te,:))==Ytarget(te));
fprintf('raw accuracy %.3f, transferred-feature accuracy %.3f\n', ...
        rawAccuracy,transferAccuracy);
bar([rawAccuracy transferAccuracy]); ylim([0 1]);
xticklabels({'raw pixels','frozen pretrained features'}); ylabel('target accuracy')
```
